(463214, 43983, 9932, '<td valign="top">Excellent work. I love the overall softness to this shot. The lighting couldn''t be better. The shadows are mysterious with the bell like shapes within and the title is great.  I would love to know how you pulled this off.  When it is over please give us all the details on how you set this shot up.</td>', 'Excellent work. I love the overall softness to this shot. The lighting couldn''t be better. The shadows are mysterious with the bell like shapes within and the title is great.  I would love to know how you pulled this off.  When it is over please give us all the details on how you set this shot up.', '2003-10-27 10:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(463216, 44003, 11800, '<td valign="top">I just relooked at this, it''s a case where the thumbnail looks better than the actual photo. Gave a 3 originally, but I''m raising it to a 6. The reason it''s not higher is because the colors look oversaturated and it''s not a shadow but a silhouette.</td>', 'I just relooked at this, it''s a case where the thumbnail looks better than the actual photo. Gave a 3 originally, but I''m raising it to a 6. The reason it''s not higher is because the colors look oversaturated and it''s not a shadow but a silhouette.', '2003-10-27 10:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
