(463235, 43889, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very well done. You took a big gamble submitting one of the  challenges biggest fears, a "dark" shot. I hope you pull it off. I did not submit my dark shot.<br/> <br/>I''m not crazy about the reflection you choice around the mouth but still a good shot.</td>', 'Very well done. You took a big gamble submitting one of the  challenges biggest fears, a "dark" shot. I hope you pull it off. I did not submit my dark shot. I''m not crazy about the reflection you choice around the mouth but still a good shot.', '2003-10-27 10:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(463242, 43890, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very good work. <br/> <br/>I''m not crazy about the background color. <br/>The shadow seems to be somewhat blury, did you use studio lights instead of sunlight? <br/>The white border I think could have been thinner.<br/> <br/>I did several of these shots and the only ones I liked were the ones I shot in bright sunlight, the shadows were 100% better.<br/> <br/>This is still a high vote for me.</td>', 'Very good work.  I''m not crazy about the background color. The shadow seems to be somewhat blury, did you use studio lights instead of sunlight? The white border I think could have been thinner. I did several of these shots and the only ones I liked were the ones I shot in bright sunlight, the shadows were 100% better. This is still a high vote for me.', '2003-10-27 11:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(463251, 43893, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea.<br/>I think your object is to small and the background is to bright.<br/>It is hard to tell the shadow from the object.<br/>This would have been a great entry for "Negative Space".<br/>I think overall a tighter shot and cropping would have helped a lot.<br/>Still a high vote for me. Great idea, and  setup just not 100% on the execution.</td>', 'Very nice idea.I think your object is to small and the background is to bright.It is hard to tell the shadow from the object.This would have been a great entry for "Negative Space".I think overall a tighter shot and cropping would have helped a lot.Still a high vote for me. Great idea, and  setup just not 100% on the execution.', '2003-10-27 11:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(463254, 43950, 9932, '<td valign="top">What an original idea. <br/>The lighting is very nice, the small splash of color against the black &amp; white is nice. How did you come up with this idea?</td>', 'What an original idea. The lighting is very nice, the small splash of color against the black & white is nice. How did you come up with this idea?', '2003-10-27 11:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(463256, 43589, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very well done. When I first looked at this shot I had a splitting headache and it took me a few minutes to see what it was. Now that I can see it clearly, I enjoy it very much. The setup, lighting, colors and focus all work together very well.</td>', 'Very well done. When I first looked at this shot I had a splitting headache and it took me a few minutes to see what it was. Now that I can see it clearly, I enjoy it very much. The setup, lighting, colors and focus all work together very well.', '2003-10-27 11:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(463258, 44085, 1570, '<td valign="top">i love this, but i would do it without the white rose which looks really fake... but the yellow one is perfect!</td>', 'i love this, but i would do it without the white rose which looks really fake... but the yellow one is perfect!', '2003-10-27 11:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(463259, 43417, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I love the lens flare effect in a lot of shots, but I think this time it is hurting your shot. There is to much of it and it becomes very annoying. Still a nice high vote.</td>', 'Very well done. I love the lens flare effect in a lot of shots, but I think this time it is hurting your shot. There is to much of it and it becomes very annoying. Still a nice high vote.', '2003-10-27 11:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(463261, 43884, 9932, '<td valign="top">Great idea but I think you fell short on the execution part.<br/>I think the composition and lighting could have been better.</td>', 'Great idea but I think you fell short on the execution part.I think the composition and lighting could have been better.', '2003-10-27 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(463263, 43558, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I do not however see where this falls into the "Shadows" challenge. <br/>I see a low lit shot of a squirrel on a tree? <br/>If I''am missing something let me know.<br/>Still a nice vote.</td>', 'Very nice. I do not however see where this falls into the "Shadows" challenge. I see a low lit shot of a squirrel on a tree? If I''am missing something let me know.Still a nice vote.', '2003-10-27 11:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(463264, 43903, 6845, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. Took me a minute to realize that the buildings were staples. I actually looked at this image skipped to the next one and then was like, wait a minute. I went back and then saw that it was the twin towers but they  weren''t with the main part of the city. I think the only reason it eventually caught my attention was the red light. I like the composition and both the shadows and the reflections really add to the image. It is a very different but pleasing way to show tribute to 9/11. Nice work.</td>', 'Excellent image. Took me a minute to realize that the buildings were staples. I actually looked at this image skipped to the next one and then was like, wait a minute. I went back and then saw that it was the twin towers but they  weren''t with the main part of the city. I think the only reason it eventually caught my attention was the red light. I like the composition and both the shadows and the reflections really add to the image. It is a very different but pleasing way to show tribute to 9/11. Nice work.', '2003-10-27 11:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(463266, 44039, 9932, '<td valign="top">Veru nice, an origianal idea. I think the idea and setup were well done but I feel you fell short on the lighting and execution of the shot. Still a nice vote.</td>', 'Veru nice, an origianal idea. I think the idea and setup were well done but I feel you fell short on the lighting and execution of the shot. Still a nice vote.', '2003-10-27 11:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(463269, 43989, 10643, '<td valign="top">Things I would change about this: I''d use white balance or levels to make the background surface lighter, I''d remove the hanging string or wire hook that distracts the eye, and I''d crop it so the shadow isn''t touching/cut off by the frame</td>', 'Things I would change about this: I''d use white balance or levels to make the background surface lighter, I''d remove the hanging string or wire hook that distracts the eye, and I''d crop it so the shadow isn''t touching/cut off by the frame', '2003-10-27 11:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(463270, 43969, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. <br/>I feel that the shadow is not the center point of attention in this shot It is the Car Land sign.<br/>Could it have been shot without the sign?</td>', 'Nice idea. I feel that the shadow is not the center point of attention in this shot It is the Car Land sign.Could it have been shot without the sign?', '2003-10-27 11:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
