(463407, 43893, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very, very minimalistic!  IMHO, it is a very good idea, but the pencil shavings are not quite clear, and neither is the distinction between shavings / shadows.  The background also is not "pure".  It''s a great idea, though, and something worth playing with more.  Maybe a bit closer, or shavings at a slightly different angle, or light that''s a little less strong  - I really don''t know.  What I''m trying to say is that I think this is a good idea, something worth exploring, but not quite there as it is.  ~6</td>', 'Very, very minimalistic!  IMHO, it is a very good idea, but the pencil shavings are not quite clear, and neither is the distinction between shavings / shadows.  The background also is not "pure".  It''s a great idea, though, and something worth playing with more.  Maybe a bit closer, or shavings at a slightly different angle, or light that''s a little less strong  - I really don''t know.  What I''m trying to say is that I think this is a good idea, something worth exploring, but not quite there as it is.  ~6', '2003-10-27 12:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
