(463637, 43871, 3569, '<td valign="top">Simply Beautiful...  Did you try cropping the dark top off, it may make another beautiful shot.</td>', 'Simply Beautiful...  Did you try cropping the dark top off, it may make another beautiful shot.', '2003-10-27 16:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(463638, 43893, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit too much none-shadow.</td>', 'A bit too much none-shadow.', '2003-10-27 16:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(463640, 43970, 3569, '<td valign="top">Definately one of the best of this challenge.  great shot.</td>', 'Definately one of the best of this challenge.  great shot.', '2003-10-27 16:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(463642, 44024, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast would have helped increase my score.</td>', 'A bit more contrast would have helped increase my score.', '2003-10-27 16:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(463650, 43950, 11283, '<td valign="top">Very creative and cool.</td>', 'Very creative and cool.', '2003-10-27 17:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(463652, 44005, 11283, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2003-10-27 17:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(463653, 43437, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast on this one. Beautiful spotlight surrounding the subject. Very interesting composition, can''t wait to here how you didi this. The donut shaped shadow really draws your eyes to it. Very vivid highlight on the object iteself.</td>', 'Very nice contrast on this one. Beautiful spotlight surrounding the subject. Very interesting composition, can''t wait to here how you didi this. The donut shaped shadow really draws your eyes to it. Very vivid highlight on the object iteself.', '2003-10-27 17:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(463656, 43638, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very graphic and dynamic shot of a musician. The shadows really help to give the figure movement. I seem almost alive. Perfect contrast helps define the shapes beautifully.</td>', 'Very graphic and dynamic shot of a musician. The shadows really help to give the figure movement. I seem almost alive. Perfect contrast helps define the shapes beautifully.', '2003-10-27 17:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(463673, 44039, 5391, '<td valign="top">Incredibly creative idea!  Technically, I''d like a little more contrast (white background, darker shadows), but you definitely get a "wow" factor for your originality!  Great job!</td>', 'Incredibly creative idea!  Technically, I''d like a little more contrast (white background, darker shadows), but you definitely get a "wow" factor for your originality!  Great job!', '2003-10-27 17:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(463679, 43889, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition with the creepy lighting effect. The shadow on the mouth reminds me of the mutant vampires from the 2nd Blade movie. The great contrast of the dark eyes with the vivid highlights really adds to the creepy effect. Great job.</td>', 'Very interesting composition with the creepy lighting effect. The shadow on the mouth reminds me of the mutant vampires from the 2nd Blade movie. The great contrast of the dark eyes with the vivid highlights really adds to the creepy effect. Great job.', '2003-10-27 17:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(463680, 44046, 5391, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity.  Beautiful.  I''d just as soon not have a frame, though - something this simple doesn''t need one - it should stay simple.  9</td>', 'Love the simplicity.  Beautiful.  I''d just as soon not have a frame, though - something this simple doesn''t need one - it should stay simple.  9', '2003-10-27 17:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(463681, 43221, 10084, '<td valign="top">The green vine is far from interesting, but the beautiful shadow totally makes this composition great. Very bold contrast in the shadows helps to show the great shapes in the leafs. Great shot.</td>', 'The green vine is far from interesting, but the beautiful shadow totally makes this composition great. Very bold contrast in the shadows helps to show the great shapes in the leafs. Great shot.', '2003-10-27 17:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(463682, 44081, 12223, '<td valign="top">8. I really like the contrasts in color and shape.  The texture is well done.  My preference would be for more clarity in the guitar''s body and strings.  The border is a bit wide, however I am fast becoming a fan of borders.</td>', '8. I really like the contrasts in color and shape.  The texture is well done.  My preference would be for more clarity in the guitar''s body and strings.  The border is a bit wide, however I am fast becoming a fan of borders.', '2003-10-27 17:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(463683, 43954, 12223, '<td valign="top">7. Cute.</td>', '7. Cute.', '2003-10-27 17:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(463684, 43780, 12223, '<td valign="top">8. Good texture.  I wish I could see the feet.</td>', '8. Good texture.  I wish I could see the feet.', '2003-10-27 17:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(463685, 44048, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. I don''t know if the lighting on the bottle could have been more lit. Seems quite dark. The effect of the shadow overturning is wonderful. Can''t wait to hear how you did it.</td>', 'Very interesting composition. I don''t know if the lighting on the bottle could have been more lit. Seems quite dark. The effect of the shadow overturning is wonderful. Can''t wait to hear how you did it.', '2003-10-27 17:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(463686, 43605, 12223, '<td valign="top">7. Very nice.  Good form within the frame. My peference would be for at least a few leaves to be crisply focused.</td>', '7. Very nice.  Good form within the frame. My peference would be for at least a few leaves to be crisply focused.', '2003-10-27 18:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(463689, 43589, 12223, '<td valign="top">8. The colors work really well.  My preference is for glass rims and bases to be very sharply focused.  I like border treatments.</td>', '8. The colors work really well.  My preference is for glass rims and bases to be very sharply focused.  I like border treatments.', '2003-10-27 18:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(463690, 44075, 12223, '<td valign="top">6.  Not being there I can''t say what other optional viewpoints were available for consideration.  The underside of the soffit overhang is not the strongest part of this photo.  I do appreciate the entry.</td>', '6.  Not being there I can''t say what other optional viewpoints were available for consideration.  The underside of the soffit overhang is not the strongest part of this photo.  I do appreciate the entry.', '2003-10-27 18:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(463692, 44003, 12223, '<td valign="top">6. I am unable to make a suggestion.</td>', '6. I am unable to make a suggestion.', '2003-10-27 18:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(463694, 44067, 12223, '<td valign="top">7. Very unique perspective.</td>', '7. Very unique perspective.', '2003-10-27 18:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(463696, 43900, 12223, '<td valign="top">7. My preference is for more detail. Well proportioned frame.</td>', '7. My preference is for more detail. Well proportioned frame.', '2003-10-27 18:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(463698, 43607, 12223, '<td valign="top">8. Geometrically appealling.</td>', '8. Geometrically appealling.', '2003-10-27 18:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(463702, 43867, 12223, '<td valign="top">8. Too pretty to be seductive. My preference would be for another option regarding the necklace.  Black glass cross with a smaller smile would be very provacative. Beautiful model. Excellant skin tone.</td>', '8. Too pretty to be seductive. My preference would be for another option regarding the necklace.  Black glass cross with a smaller smile would be very provacative. Beautiful model. Excellant skin tone.', '2003-10-27 18:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
