(463715, 43919, 12223, '<td valign="top">8. Good solid B&amp;W.</td>', '8. Good solid B&W.', '2003-10-27 18:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(463716, 44002, 12223, '<td valign="top">9. Really nice photograph.  I hope this scores very high. The shadow is perfect in its representation.</td>', '9. Really nice photograph.  I hope this scores very high. The shadow is perfect in its representation.', '2003-10-27 18:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(463717, 43638, 12223, '<td valign="top">8.  Well done.  Almost could not tell that there was a shadow.</td>', '8.  Well done.  Almost could not tell that there was a shadow.', '2003-10-27 18:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(463718, 43893, 12223, '<td valign="top">7. I wish the shaving was more clearly focused.  The shadow in this case works well.  I would like to see a version with a border, although I know that some have criticized them.</td>', '7. I wish the shaving was more clearly focused.  The shadow in this case works well.  I would like to see a version with a border, although I know that some have criticized them.', '2003-10-27 18:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(463719, 43511, 12223, '<td valign="top">8. Clear. Good arrangement.</td>', '8. Clear. Good arrangement.', '2003-10-27 18:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(463721, 43822, 12223, '<td valign="top">9. Well framed shot.</td>', '9. Well framed shot.', '2003-10-27 18:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(463722, 43903, 12045, '<td valign="top">Extremely Creative!</td>', 'Extremely Creative!', '2003-10-27 18:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(463737, 43941, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and I think I know what you were trying to do but this photo has two big flaws with the foreground being so out of focus and the background way overexposed.  Keep experimenting and you''ll be able to pull stuff like this off no problem.</td>', 'Nice idea and I think I know what you were trying to do but this photo has two big flaws with the foreground being so out of focus and the background way overexposed.  Keep experimenting and you''ll be able to pull stuff like this off no problem.', '2003-10-27 18:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(463744, 44048, 12045, '<td valign="top">A little more back light to make the upside down bottle stand out more (assuming thats how you did it) would have made this photo a 10!  Well no a 9 as to be a 10 it would have needed to be Miller Lite!  :-)  NIce idea.  Good focus.</td>', 'A little more back light to make the upside down bottle stand out more (assuming thats how you did it) would have made this photo a 10!  Well no a 9 as to be a 10 it would have needed to be Miller Lite!  :-)  NIce idea.  Good focus.', '2003-10-27 18:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(463870, 44044, 10128, '<td valign="top">I think you unpurposely trivialize the Incarnation, and were tricky with the photo, so I give you a one. But I do it it love.</td>', 'I think you unpurposely trivialize the Incarnation, and were tricky with the photo, so I give you a one. But I do it it love.', '2003-10-27 19:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(463919, 43950, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot.  Good angle and crop. 9</td>', 'Very creative shot.  Good angle and crop. 9', '2003-10-27 20:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(463929, 44080, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on a classic theme.  Good work :)</td>', 'Very nice take on a classic theme.  Good work :)', '2003-10-27 20:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(463931, 43890, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure and composition.  I love the soft color of the background...</td>', 'Excellent exposure and composition.  I love the soft color of the background...', '2003-10-27 20:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(463932, 44088, 10643, '<td valign="top">I really like the repeition of this, and also the angle you flipped it to. The only way to improve it I think would be to have the rows closer together, especially on the left, to form a solid grid. the illusion is very striking.</td>', 'I really like the repeition of this, and also the angle you flipped it to. The only way to improve it I think would be to have the rows closer together, especially on the left, to form a solid grid. the illusion is very striking.', '2003-10-27 20:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(463933, 43903, 772, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea and nice execution :)  The red dot adds that special element to this photo...</td>', 'Very creative idea and nice execution :)  The red dot adds that special element to this photo...', '2003-10-27 20:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(463935, 44046, 10643, '<td valign="top">very simple and has a lot of character. It reminds me of the stowaway picture in the inside looking out challenge, which I loved. hope you do well!</td>', 'very simple and has a lot of character. It reminds me of the stowaway picture in the inside looking out challenge, which I loved. hope you do well!', '2003-10-27 20:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(463936, 43937, 10643, '<td valign="top">Thiis is really beautiful. If I had to nitpick I''d say I''m not crazy about the border; I think it would be better without the unnecessary details at the corners.</td>', 'Thiis is really beautiful. If I had to nitpick I''d say I''m not crazy about the border; I think it would be better without the unnecessary details at the corners.', '2003-10-27 20:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(463938, 43903, 10643, '<td valign="top">outstanding! i love this! It looks like it was fun to set up. I''ve shown it to everyone in my office already, and I''ve been looking at pictures to see if it''s as accurate as I think it is. just wonderful.</td>', 'outstanding! i love this! It looks like it was fun to set up. I''ve shown it to everyone in my office already, and I''ve been looking at pictures to see if it''s as accurate as I think it is. just wonderful.', '2003-10-27 20:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(463940, 44004, 10643, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. the color is deep and accurate, the focus is great, and the lighting has the "scary" feel of Halloween without beating you over the head with it.</td>', 'I like this very much. the color is deep and accurate, the focus is great, and the lighting has the "scary" feel of Halloween without beating you over the head with it.', '2003-10-27 20:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(463941, 43789, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.... excellent use of light and shadow to create effect and impact. = 10</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.... excellent use of light and shadow to create effect and impact. = 10', '2003-10-27 20:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(463943, 43262, 10643, '<td valign="top">definitely in my top 10 for the challenge. the delicacy of the feather creates very intricate shadows and light. black &amp; white is absolutely the right choice here.</td>', 'definitely in my top 10 for the challenge. the delicacy of the feather creates very intricate shadows and light. black & white is absolutely the right choice here.', '2003-10-27 20:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(463944, 43893, 10643, '<td valign="top">the shape of the shaving forms a wonderful illusion of "infinity" with its shadow. it''s a nice effect, at once solid and delicate. I think I would like it better with less white space, but not a *lot* less.</td>', 'the shape of the shaving forms a wonderful illusion of "infinity" with its shadow. it''s a nice effect, at once solid and delicate. I think I would like it better with less white space, but not a *lot* less.', '2003-10-27 20:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(463945, 43950, 10643, '<td valign="top">it''s not really clear that this is on the definition of "photography" -- kind of wish it was a photography book, or a love story, to make that more obvious. on the whole though this is a very neat effect, and I''m kind of surprised I haven''t seen it before.</td>', 'it''s not really clear that this is on the definition of "photography" -- kind of wish it was a photography book, or a love story, to make that more obvious. on the whole though this is a very neat effect, and I''m kind of surprised I haven''t seen it before.', '2003-10-27 20:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(463947, 44076, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful work... nice painterly feel to this image.. the softness is compelling...</td>', 'beautiful work... nice painterly feel to this image.. the softness is compelling...', '2003-10-27 20:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(463955, 43394, 10643, '<td valign="top">nice! the vibrant colors of the flower ofset the dark shadow well. what kind of flower is this?</td>', 'nice! the vibrant colors of the flower ofset the dark shadow well. what kind of flower is this?', '2003-10-27 20:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(463956, 43970, 10643, '<td valign="top">very nice. looks clean and clear enough to be a picture in a magazine or museum exhibit.</td>', 'very nice. looks clean and clear enough to be a picture in a magazine or museum exhibit.', '2003-10-27 20:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(463957, 44002, 10643, '<td valign="top">a moving picture, could also work well in the "grace" challenge!</td>', 'a moving picture, could also work well in the "grace" challenge!', '2003-10-27 20:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(463959, 43923, 10643, '<td valign="top">great job, reminds me of the romantic diamond TV commercials!</td>', 'great job, reminds me of the romantic diamond TV commercials!', '2003-10-27 20:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(463967, 44039, 12131, '<td valign="top">That is trully clever.  I like the way you did that, excellent use of shadow.  One suggestion I have would be that lines between the walls were somewhat lessened or illiminated.  They take away from the picture somewhat.  Though at the same time, its freaky not being able to tell how that DPC thing is where it is....I can''t see a string.</td>', 'That is trully clever.  I like the way you did that, excellent use of shadow.  One suggestion I have would be that lines between the walls were somewhat lessened or illiminated.  They take away from the picture somewhat.  Though at the same time, its freaky not being able to tell how that DPC thing is where it is....I can''t see a string.', '2003-10-27 21:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(463968, 43446, 5475, '<td valign="top">This looks like something my Mom would do...  Are you my Mom??</td>', 'This looks like something my Mom would do...  Are you my Mom??', '2003-10-27 21:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(463969, 44039, 7628, '<td valign="top">A very imaginative idea - works very well with the subject.  Must have been very difficult to light.  While the shadows are very interesting the carved wood is not so captivating.  Bravo for innovation, hard effort and intriguing results.</td>', 'A very imaginative idea - works very well with the subject.  Must have been very difficult to light.  While the shadows are very interesting the carved wood is not so captivating.  Bravo for innovation, hard effort and intriguing results.', '2003-10-27 21:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(463970, 44081, 12131, '<td valign="top">Yeah, that''s a little weird  But interesting. The blinds are good because they give the picture continuity.</td>', 'Yeah, that''s a little weird  But interesting. The blinds are good because they give the picture continuity.', '2003-10-27 21:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(463971, 43499, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the shape of the shadows.  Wish it were all sharper.</td>', 'I like the shape of the shadows.  Wish it were all sharper.', '2003-10-27 21:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(463973, 44075, 7628, '<td valign="top">Shadows at night is a novel idea.  The maroon color is neat.  I like the composition of the bright windows in the top corner.  I''d like to see how this looks a bit darker - perhaps the real leaves would anchor the corner more.</td>', 'Shadows at night is a novel idea.  The maroon color is neat.  I like the composition of the bright windows in the top corner.  I''d like to see how this looks a bit darker - perhaps the real leaves would anchor the corner more.', '2003-10-27 21:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(463975, 43693, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun effect.  I like the inverse shadow of the whisk on the egg - very subtle.  I like the blue - was that a natural result of the colors present or a choice of yours - I think the blue goes well with the "fresh" idea.</td>', 'Fun effect.  I like the inverse shadow of the whisk on the egg - very subtle.  I like the blue - was that a natural result of the colors present or a choice of yours - I think the blue goes well with the "fresh" idea.', '2003-10-27 21:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(463977, 44028, 12131, '<td valign="top">It looks a step out of another time, And I like the way the shadow is so crisp but at the same time her skirt is kind of grainy.  It looks almost smugged about at the knee.  Still fun idea.  I think it needs a train pulling away.</td>', 'It looks a step out of another time, And I like the way the shadow is so crisp but at the same time her skirt is kind of grainy.  It looks almost smugged about at the knee.  Still fun idea.  I think it needs a train pulling away.', '2003-10-27 21:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(463979, 43221, 7628, '<td valign="top">The crispness of the shadows - so spikey - against the simple wood is great.  I wish the light on the real vine weren''t so glaring, it takes away ffrom the clean simplicity of the shadow, but I like the sigle line of bright green in an otherwise colorless pic.</td>', 'The crispness of the shadows - so spikey - against the simple wood is great.  I wish the light on the real vine weren''t so glaring, it takes away ffrom the clean simplicity of the shadow, but I like the sigle line of bright green in an otherwise colorless pic.', '2003-10-27 21:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(463980, 43903, 12131, '<td valign="top">Clever and sad.  I wouldn''t have thought that outside the box and I love it.  There''s only one detail and it doesn''t necessarily bother me so much as it is just there.  I can see reflections of the red point on the other "buildings".  Over all, impressive shot.</td>', 'Clever and sad.  I wouldn''t have thought that outside the box and I love it.  There''s only one detail and it doesn''t necessarily bother me so much as it is just there.  I can see reflections of the red point on the other "buildings".  Over all, impressive shot.', '2003-10-27 21:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(463981, 43986, 7628, '<td valign="top">Peering out of the shadows, nice use of negative space.  Wishthe trees had had better color for you.  I like that one leaf on the floor - it would be really cool if it were bright red or yellow - connecting the abstract world of light and shadow with the outside world of trees.</td>', 'Peering out of the shadows, nice use of negative space.  Wishthe trees had had better color for you.  I like that one leaf on the floor - it would be really cool if it were bright red or yellow - connecting the abstract world of light and shadow with the outside world of trees.', '2003-10-27 21:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(463984, 44087, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lots of levels in this picture - lovely to look at.  The crisp lines of the leaf contrsct nicely with both the dry curled up leaf and the wavey watery shadow.</td>', 'Lots of levels in this picture - lovely to look at.  The crisp lines of the leaf contrsct nicely with both the dry curled up leaf and the wavey watery shadow.', '2003-10-27 21:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(463985, 43648, 7628, '<td valign="top">The top line of the bulb against the dark background is very nice.  Ironic to have the subject be a light source that isn''t the source of the light :)  The diagonal composition is good.</td>', 'The top line of the bulb against the dark background is very nice.  Ironic to have the subject be a light source that isn''t the source of the light :)  The diagonal composition is good.', '2003-10-27 21:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(463987, 43871, 7628, '<td valign="top">gorgeous colors!  Reflections on the water and the geese silouetted by the light.  I''d crop of the top - whatever it is in the distance there is just distracting from the ethereal image.  8</td>', 'gorgeous colors!  Reflections on the water and the geese silouetted by the light.  I''d crop of the top - whatever it is in the distance there is just distracting from the ethereal image.  8', '2003-10-27 21:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(463991, 44059, 7628, '<td valign="top">An inviting image - I want to walk into the frame.  I like the composition - the leaves guiding our eyes down the path, the shadowy trees arching overhead.  Greater DOF would work well - at least to have the leaves in the foreground sharp to make the viewer feel a part of that reality - the lack of focus in the distance works fine - makes us want to walk in - to get closer and see better. 7</td>', 'An inviting image - I want to walk into the frame.  I like the composition - the leaves guiding our eyes down the path, the shadowy trees arching overhead.  Greater DOF would work well - at least to have the leaves in the foreground sharp to make the viewer feel a part of that reality - the lack of focus in the distance works fine - makes us want to walk in - to get closer and see better. 7', '2003-10-27 21:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(463992, 43417, 7628, '<td valign="top">lovely lines and colors - great deep blue. would work well for grace too.  Wish there weren;t so much "stuff" on the far shore - it is a bit distracting.</td>', 'lovely lines and colors - great deep blue. would work well for grace too.  Wish there weren;t so much "stuff" on the far shore - it is a bit distracting.', '2003-10-27 21:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(463997, 44046, 7628, '<td valign="top">The simplicity works well.  Maybe crop just a tad more on the left?  I want to reach into the pic and pull that handle - what will it open?</td>', 'The simplicity works well.  Maybe crop just a tad more on the left?  I want to reach into the pic and pull that handle - what will it open?', '2003-10-27 21:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(463999, 43523, 11769, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shapes. Like the old fork with the scratches. 10</td>', 'Nice use of shapes. Like the old fork with the scratches. 10', '2003-10-27 21:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(464000, 43947, 11769, '<td valign="top">This looks sorta scary. Great idea.9</td>', 'This looks sorta scary. Great idea.9', '2003-10-27 21:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(464001, 43950, 11769, '<td valign="top">Super clear image. The shadow may be secondary to the light shining through the filter but nevertheless I for one give you a 10 for creativity.</td>', 'Super clear image. The shadow may be secondary to the light shining through the filter but nevertheless I for one give you a 10 for creativity.', '2003-10-27 21:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(464006, 43889, 11769, '<td valign="top">My word that is horrible. Effective shadows. 8 :)</td>', 'My word that is horrible. Effective shadows. 8 :)', '2003-10-27 21:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(464039, 43607, 11800, '<td valign="top">Lovely yin and yang. I might have even perfered that portion of the image isolated from the bottom. This is the kind of abstract that is really pleasing to look at. As it is, I would like to see the contrast pumped so there were only a few colors.</td>', 'Lovely yin and yang. I might have even perfered that portion of the image isolated from the bottom. This is the kind of abstract that is really pleasing to look at. As it is, I would like to see the contrast pumped so there were only a few colors.', '2003-10-27 22:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(464041, 43944, 11800, '<td valign="top">The shadows are a very subtle part of this image. The building is very striking and you did a good job capturing it at the perfect time of day. I don''t know how to score this. I will be back.</td>', 'The shadows are a very subtle part of this image. The building is very striking and you did a good job capturing it at the perfect time of day. I don''t know how to score this. I will be back.', '2003-10-27 22:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
