(464075, 43675, 10263, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Why can''t I think of these things!</td>', 'Very nicely done. Why can''t I think of these things!', '2003-10-27 23:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(464107, 43986, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful clarity...I love the view from the windows..so crisp and vivid!</td>', 'wonderful clarity...I love the view from the windows..so crisp and vivid!', '2003-10-28 00:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(464108, 43589, 11800, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The purple reminds me of concord grapes and the orange is warm and they compliment each other. The two orange wings and the person(?) in the reflection are distracting. I like the dof for the glass but feel the bottle should be sharper. The composition feels to crowded towards the top. It feels like the glass is about to fall over. An intriguing image!</td>', 'Interesting. The purple reminds me of concord grapes and the orange is warm and they compliment each other. The two orange wings and the person(?) in the reflection are distracting. I like the dof for the glass but feel the bottle should be sharper. The composition feels to crowded towards the top. It feels like the glass is about to fall over. An intriguing image!', '2003-10-28 00:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(464129, 43867, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good image. Enough light to see enought to keep it interesting and dark enough to keep the mystery. Looks more like a painting than a photo. I don''t feel that this was the spirit of the challenge, but it''s still a good image.</td>', 'Good image. Enough light to see enought to keep it interesting and dark enough to keep the mystery. Looks more like a painting than a photo. I don''t feel that this was the spirit of the challenge, but it''s still a good image.', '2003-10-28 01:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(464130, 43889, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is really a creepy picture. Well done.</td>', 'This is really a creepy picture. Well done.', '2003-10-28 01:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(464212, 43730, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a nice autumn photo, I like the color and clarity - great focus.  There are shadows in the piece, so it fits the challenge, but it doesn''t seem like the shadows are the focus of the image.  A different interpretation I guess.   Lighting is great.  Good interest from all the different items shown.  7</td>', 'This is a nice autumn photo, I like the color and clarity - great focus.  There are shadows in the piece, so it fits the challenge, but it doesn''t seem like the shadows are the focus of the image.  A different interpretation I guess.   Lighting is great.  Good interest from all the different items shown.  7', '2003-10-28 03:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(464213, 44022, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image!  I love the color, and the refraction at the top makes a very brilliant halo.  Composition is fabulous, I wish I could''ve gotten a shadow so sharp.  Very well done.  8</td>', 'Great image!  I love the color, and the refraction at the top makes a very brilliant halo.  Composition is fabulous, I wish I could''ve gotten a shadow so sharp.  Very well done.  8', '2003-10-28 03:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(464216, 43580, 11923, '<td valign="top">Ok.. I give up.. I don''t get it  :(   I''m not seeing the shadow aspect here, I don''t really understand what I am looking at to be honest.  Seems like a blurred piece of paper being held up by something.  I''m sure my perception is probably very skewed and I''m missing a very simple element but there it is all the same.  3</td>', 'Ok.. I give up.. I don''t get it  :(   I''m not seeing the shadow aspect here, I don''t really understand what I am looking at to be honest.  Seems like a blurred piece of paper being held up by something.  I''m sure my perception is probably very skewed and I''m missing a very simple element but there it is all the same.  3', '2003-10-28 03:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(464218, 43969, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good capture!  The whole composition fits so well together.  Of course the glare of light is distracting, but the shape of the shadow is well defined and fits the challenge perfectly.  A very nice photo.  6</td>', 'Good capture!  The whole composition fits so well together.  Of course the glare of light is distracting, but the shape of the shadow is well defined and fits the challenge perfectly.  A very nice photo.  6', '2003-10-28 03:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
