(464401, 43983, 3294, '<td valign="top">Although I see shadows (had to look for them) glass doesn''t really give much of one.  Pretty photo, but it''s a stretch to meet the challenge. IMHO.</td>', 'Although I see shadows (had to look for them) glass doesn''t really give much of one.  Pretty photo, but it''s a stretch to meet the challenge. IMHO.', '2003-10-28 10:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(464403, 43856, 3294, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just me, but I''m seeing a lot of jagged egdes.  Maybe over sharpened?  Also, the photo is kinda nice but it isnt very exciting... almost too common if a sight to even notice the shadows?  Just my opinion.</td>', 'Maybe it''s just me, but I''m seeing a lot of jagged egdes.  Maybe over sharpened?  Also, the photo is kinda nice but it isnt very exciting... almost too common if a sight to even notice the shadows?  Just my opinion.', '2003-10-28 10:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(464406, 44059, 3294, '<td valign="top">Wonderful DOF.  At first glance I thought this was a miniature landscape or something, like at the putt putt golf course.  Although the shadows are everywhere, it''s almost too hard to see how it compliments the photo.</td>', 'Wonderful DOF.  At first glance I thought this was a miniature landscape or something, like at the putt putt golf course.  Although the shadows are everywhere, it''s almost too hard to see how it compliments the photo.', '2003-10-28 10:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(464409, 44048, 12617, '<td valign="top">nicely done.<br/>was gonna say a couple improvements possible, but after looking harder, well done!</td>', 'nicely done.was gonna say a couple improvements possible, but after looking harder, well done!', '2003-10-28 10:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(464413, 43563, 3294, '<td valign="top">I know there are shdows, but it doesn''t seem to add to this shot.  It''s a pretty ohot, but it''s a stretch to meet the challenge... to me.</td>', 'I know there are shdows, but it doesn''t seem to add to this shot.  It''s a pretty ohot, but it''s a stretch to meet the challenge... to me.', '2003-10-28 11:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
