(464415, 43417, 3294, '<td valign="top">Seems more reflections than shadows.  In fact, I''m struggling to find any shadows... there are dark places, but it doesn''t feel to me that light has cast a shadow.  Just my opinion.</td>', 'Seems more reflections than shadows.  In fact, I''m struggling to find any shadows... there are dark places, but it doesn''t feel to me that light has cast a shadow.  Just my opinion.', '2003-10-28 11:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
