(465019, 43928, 6349, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this shot.  It''s my favorite in the whole challenge.  Hope you do well.  10</td>', 'I LOVE this shot.  It''s my favorite in the whole challenge.  Hope you do well.  10', '2003-10-28 22:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(465020, 44045, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Really nice composition and use of the shadows.  Black and white was a perfect choice.  10</td>', 'Great shot.  Really nice composition and use of the shadows.  Black and white was a perfect choice.  10', '2003-10-28 22:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(465022, 43727, 6349, '<td valign="top">I love the mood created here and the subtle color of the door.  The only problem is that the highlights are more dramatic than the shadows, which I like, but other people might not.  One of my four 10''s.</td>', 'I love the mood created here and the subtle color of the door.  The only problem is that the highlights are more dramatic than the shadows, which I like, but other people might not.  One of my four 10''s.', '2003-10-28 22:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(465023, 43788, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome find.  I think I would have preferred this from straight on (of course, you would have then been in the way of the shadow, huh?).. 9</td>', 'This is an awesome find.  I think I would have preferred this from straight on (of course, you would have then been in the way of the shadow, huh?).. 9', '2003-10-28 22:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(465024, 43970, 6349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting.  This looks a lot like the spilled milk photo from a little while ago.  Great job. 9</td>', 'Beautiful lighting.  This looks a lot like the spilled milk photo from a little while ago.  Great job. 9', '2003-10-28 22:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(465025, 43221, 6349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  The only flaws are the slight shadow in the upper right and the almost plastic looking texture of the vine makes it look a little out of focus or oversharpened or something.  Great shot.  9</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  The only flaws are the slight shadow in the upper right and the almost plastic looking texture of the vine makes it look a little out of focus or oversharpened or something.  Great shot.  9', '2003-10-28 22:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(465026, 43950, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  How''d you come up with this one?  Why photocell?  9</td>', 'Great idea.  How''d you come up with this one?  Why photocell?  9', '2003-10-28 22:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(465029, 43308, 6349, '<td valign="top">SImply beautiful.  I could see this as a huge painting on my wall.  Only problem I can see is with the crop?  I can''t see a reason for not cropping the bottom up to the bottom of the stem/branch.  9</td>', 'SImply beautiful.  I could see this as a huge painting on my wall.  Only problem I can see is with the crop?  I can''t see a reason for not cropping the bottom up to the bottom of the stem/branch.  9', '2003-10-28 22:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(465030, 43394, 6349, '<td valign="top">This shot is really intriguing.  The flower, unlike most of the others in the challenge, is interesting by itself and the way you''ve incorporated the shadow is also unique and unexpected.  The only problem I have with it is that the composition seems a little bit awkward and unbalanced.  But thats just my opinion.  Overall, a top shot.  9</td>', 'This shot is really intriguing.  The flower, unlike most of the others in the challenge, is interesting by itself and the way you''ve incorporated the shadow is also unique and unexpected.  The only problem I have with it is that the composition seems a little bit awkward and unbalanced.  But thats just my opinion.  Overall, a top shot.  9', '2003-10-28 22:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
