(466155, 43635, 2883, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern this makes. The right upper corner is a little distracting.</td>', 'I like the pattern this makes. The right upper corner is a little distracting.', '2003-10-29 15:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(466156, 43954, 2883, '<td valign="top">Good use of shadows. The colors look a little sloppy at the edges. Good concept.</td>', 'Good use of shadows. The colors look a little sloppy at the edges. Good concept.', '2003-10-29 15:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(466159, 43989, 2883, '<td valign="top">Some colored lighting might make this a more interesting photo.</td>', 'Some colored lighting might make this a more interesting photo.', '2003-10-29 15:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(466162, 43966, 2883, '<td valign="top">This seems to be emphasizing the light instead of the shadow. Interesting pattern.</td>', 'This seems to be emphasizing the light instead of the shadow. Interesting pattern.', '2003-10-29 15:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(466164, 44013, 2883, '<td valign="top">Good use of lighting and shadows. I think a little less crop on the bottom end would be an improvement.</td>', 'Good use of lighting and shadows. I think a little less crop on the bottom end would be an improvement.', '2003-10-29 15:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(466166, 43947, 2883, '<td valign="top">Great concept and a clean shadow, very good.</td>', 'Great concept and a clean shadow, very good.', '2003-10-29 15:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(466167, 43558, 2883, '<td valign="top">Being in a shadow and showing a shadow are two different things. Here, the shadow hurts the photo by making it appear under exposed. Oh, and squirrels are evil! They''ll take your nuts!!!</td>', 'Being in a shadow and showing a shadow are two different things. Here, the shadow hurts the photo by making it appear under exposed. Oh, and squirrels are evil! They''ll take your nuts!!!', '2003-10-29 15:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(466168, 44050, 2883, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been better if the shadow was more proportioned to the light bulb. My first impression is ''Mandark''s head''.</td>', 'I think it would have been better if the shadow was more proportioned to the light bulb. My first impression is ''Mandark''s head''.', '2003-10-29 15:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(466169, 43950, 2883, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of the filter''s shadow. Great lighting.</td>', 'Wonderful use of the filter''s shadow. Great lighting.', '2003-10-29 15:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(466170, 44076, 2883, '<td valign="top">Nice artistic use of shadows. It almost looks charred onto a piece of wood.</td>', 'Nice artistic use of shadows. It almost looks charred onto a piece of wood.', '2003-10-29 15:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(466174, 44014, 2883, '<td valign="top">The overall mood in this photo is cold, mostly due to the coloring. I think it would better if the photo was rotated 180.</td>', 'The overall mood in this photo is cold, mostly due to the coloring. I think it would better if the photo was rotated 180.', '2003-10-29 15:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(466210, 44048, 11793, '<td valign="top">bud light?  might as well just drink water ;}<br/> <br/>cool effect<br/> <br/>soup</td>', 'bud light?  might as well just drink water ;} cool effect soup', '2003-10-29 15:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(466232, 44052, 11895, '<td valign="top">I see a silhouette but no shadow, but a decent cat picture</td>', 'I see a silhouette but no shadow, but a decent cat picture', '2003-10-29 15:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(466237, 43417, 11895, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture, but seems more like reflections than shadows</td>', 'beautiful picture, but seems more like reflections than shadows', '2003-10-29 15:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(466296, 44046, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures in the paint - and a great shape and shadow. Seems a bit "shiny" to the left - can''t quite describe the effect but I''m not keen on it. Like the overall composition, though would shave a small touch off the left.</td>', 'Wonderful textures in the paint - and a great shape and shadow. Seems a bit "shiny" to the left - can''t quite describe the effect but I''m not keen on it. Like the overall composition, though would shave a small touch off the left.', '2003-10-29 16:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(466297, 44076, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an interesting texture - it''s like shadow puppetry! Is that just me or is the orange surface between camera and objects? Looks great!</td>', 'What an interesting texture - it''s like shadow puppetry! Is that just me or is the orange surface between camera and objects? Looks great!', '2003-10-29 16:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(466298, 43523, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a clever use of shadow! Rather striking!</td>', 'What a clever use of shadow! Rather striking!', '2003-10-29 16:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(466299, 43921, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the stretched parallel lines of the handrail shadows and the inclusion of the legs and feet only of the pedestrians adds a focal point without moving focus from the shadows to the people.</td>', 'Love the stretched parallel lines of the handrail shadows and the inclusion of the legs and feet only of the pedestrians adds a focal point without moving focus from the shadows to the people.', '2003-10-29 16:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(466300, 44059, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful use of low perspective, shallow DOF and minimal lighting. I like this very very much - it''s strongly evocative of mood and place.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful use of low perspective, shallow DOF and minimal lighting. I like this very very much - it''s strongly evocative of mood and place.', '2003-10-29 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(466302, 44062, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot though the lower right lets it down a little. Great abstraction of shapes and lines whilst still retaining recognisability (is that even a word) of the subject matter.</td>', 'Interesting shot though the lower right lets it down a little. Great abstraction of shapes and lines whilst still retaining recognisability (is that even a word) of the subject matter.', '2003-10-29 16:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(466304, 43308, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fantastic texture and colour in the background rock really sets off the shadow - implies the plant is some ancient variety from the time when dinos roamed the earth - or maybe that''s just me? I do like diagonal composition with plant rooted in lower right corner.</td>', 'Fantastic texture and colour in the background rock really sets off the shadow - implies the plant is some ancient variety from the time when dinos roamed the earth - or maybe that''s just me? I do like diagonal composition with plant rooted in lower right corner.', '2003-10-29 17:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(466305, 44049, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and the strong shadows really enhance the mood. I''d like to crop some of the black background from left and possibly top to bring her face more horizontally central.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and the strong shadows really enhance the mood. I''d like to crop some of the black background from left and possibly top to bring her face more horizontally central.', '2003-10-29 17:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(466308, 44002, 3087, '<td valign="top">No idea if these are the same pair in the other current (or recent) challenge but I much prefer this image. Looking at the shoes face on to one provides more interest, texture and focal point - the text adds interesting detail. The shadow also adds something to the frame though I''m not sure it''s position in the frame relative to the shoes is quite right. A lovely shot telling just the first part of the story - who''s shoes are these and what is her story?</td>', 'No idea if these are the same pair in the other current (or recent) challenge but I much prefer this image. Looking at the shoes face on to one provides more interest, texture and focal point - the text adds interesting detail. The shadow also adds something to the frame though I''m not sure it''s position in the frame relative to the shoes is quite right. A lovely shot telling just the first part of the story - who''s shoes are these and what is her story?', '2003-10-29 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(466310, 43732, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait - the lines of the blind and the light and shadow lines on the model really add interest. The pool of light around her left eye and the highlight within it are particularly good.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait - the lines of the blind and the light and shadow lines on the model really add interest. The pool of light around her left eye and the highlight within it are particularly good.', '2003-10-29 17:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(466314, 43262, 3087, '<td valign="top">So light, so soft. I can feel the breeze. A beautiful image with wonderful loose composition and the most beautiful light on the feather. I love the DOF choice throwing the backmost fringes of the feather out of focus.</td>', 'So light, so soft. I can feel the breeze. A beautiful image with wonderful loose composition and the most beautiful light on the feather. I love the DOF choice throwing the backmost fringes of the feather out of focus.', '2003-10-29 17:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(466317, 43437, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strong graphical abstract - high grain works well here.</td>', 'Strong graphical abstract - high grain works well here.', '2003-10-29 17:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(466320, 43890, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this - how refreshing to see the flower head on and the shadow providing the context of vase etc. A great composition and the pink background works beautifully.</td>', 'I really like this - how refreshing to see the flower head on and the shadow providing the context of vase etc. A great composition and the pink background works beautifully.', '2003-10-29 17:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(466347, 43353, 6536, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white shot. Good composition and cropping. Nice lighting and shadows effect. 7.</td>', 'Nice black and white shot. Good composition and cropping. Nice lighting and shadows effect. 7.', '2003-10-29 17:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(466353, 43968, 6536, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I like the angle. Very creative. Nice composition and cropping. Good lighting and shadow effect. Good DOF and focus. 8.</td>', 'Cool shot.  I like the angle. Very creative. Nice composition and cropping. Good lighting and shadow effect. Good DOF and focus. 8.', '2003-10-29 17:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(466355, 43605, 6597, '<td valign="top">nice shadow nothing like  nature for light 7</td>', 'nice shadow nothing like  nature for light 7', '2003-10-29 17:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(466361, 43950, 6597, '<td valign="top">Pretty shadow and unusal that makes it very interesting 7</td>', 'Pretty shadow and unusal that makes it very interesting 7', '2003-10-29 17:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(466364, 43686, 6536, '<td valign="top">Wow! Excellent shot. I love the lighting and shadow effect. Great angle and composition. 10.</td>', 'Wow! Excellent shot. I love the lighting and shadow effect. Great angle and composition. 10.', '2003-10-29 17:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(466366, 43887, 6536, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Very creative. 7.</td>', 'Nice idea. Very creative. 7.', '2003-10-29 17:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(466435, 44039, 12735, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! Very creative and original.</td>', 'Excellent shot! Very creative and original.', '2003-10-29 18:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(466453, 43867, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice highlight against shadow. The very warm lighting gives a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice highlight against shadow. The very warm lighting gives a nice touch.', '2003-10-29 19:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(466454, 43970, 12448, '<td valign="top">Perfection, I did not hesitate to give this a 10, excellent</td>', 'Perfection, I did not hesitate to give this a 10, excellent', '2003-10-29 19:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(466457, 43675, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very clever solution to the challenge, and a pretty picture besides. Reminds me a bit of the classic negative space demonstration (is this a picture of two knights or a gray heart?).</td>', 'Very clever solution to the challenge, and a pretty picture besides. Reminds me a bit of the classic negative space demonstration (is this a picture of two knights or a gray heart?).', '2003-10-29 19:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(466458, 43732, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful, the lines, the contrasts it all works so well together, a 10</td>', 'This is wonderful, the lines, the contrasts it all works so well together, a 10', '2003-10-29 19:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(466460, 43783, 12448, '<td valign="top">This really caught my eye in the thumbnails, the ying and yang is a perfect title for this, if the shadow had been just a little more to the same size or sharper this would be a 10, a 9 from me though.</td>', 'This really caught my eye in the thumbnails, the ying and yang is a perfect title for this, if the shadow had been just a little more to the same size or sharper this would be a 10, a 9 from me though.', '2003-10-29 19:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(466461, 43921, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting interplay of structural shadows and people.</td>', 'An interesting interplay of structural shadows and people.', '2003-10-29 19:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(466462, 43523, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very cool, took me a second to figure this out but then I saw how you did it, I think :)  The two tones on the shadow are a bit distracting at first and makes you wonder what caused it.  An 8 to start</td>', 'Very cool, took me a second to figure this out but then I saw how you did it, I think :)  The two tones on the shadow are a bit distracting at first and makes you wonder what caused it.  An 8 to start', '2003-10-29 19:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(466463, 43638, 12448, '<td valign="top">Which is the original and which is the shadow?  You have to really look at it a couple of times to tell.  Well done, good contrast, the only minus I can find is the one leg getting cut off on the bottom, an 8 to start</td>', 'Which is the original and which is the shadow?  You have to really look at it a couple of times to tell.  Well done, good contrast, the only minus I can find is the one leg getting cut off on the bottom, an 8 to start', '2003-10-29 19:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(466464, 43889, 12733, '<td valign="top">What a weird effect of light and shadow. Is this a red circular light?</td>', 'What a weird effect of light and shadow. Is this a red circular light?', '2003-10-29 19:06:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(466465, 44019, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is awesome, the way the dew shows up is amasing.  Such colors and clarity.  Started with an 8 but going to a 9 for now.</td>', 'This is awesome, the way the dew shows up is amasing.  Such colors and clarity.  Started with an 8 but going to a 9 for now.', '2003-10-29 19:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(466466, 43934, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love prisms!  The colors, the lights are always so much fun!  But in this instants they are a bit distracting and take away from the main shadow for me.  An 8 to start</td>', 'I love prisms!  The colors, the lights are always so much fun!  But in this instants they are a bit distracting and take away from the main shadow for me.  An 8 to start', '2003-10-29 19:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(466467, 43986, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting shadow play inside, and a great view outside. The leaf on the floor is a distraction. If it wasn''t deliberate, it should have been picked up.</td>', 'Interesting shadow play inside, and a great view outside. The leaf on the floor is a distraction. If it wasn''t deliberate, it should have been picked up.', '2003-10-29 19:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(466468, 43884, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great lighting to produce the wheel shadow.</td>', 'Great lighting to produce the wheel shadow.', '2003-10-29 19:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(466469, 44080, 12733, '<td valign="top">The really interesting shadows are the ones that show the texture and the lines of the skin.</td>', 'The really interesting shadows are the ones that show the texture and the lines of the skin.', '2003-10-29 19:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(466472, 43919, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting highlights, well set off by shadows. A few bright spots near the bottom detract from the effect.</td>', 'Interesting highlights, well set off by shadows. A few bright spots near the bottom detract from the effect.', '2003-10-29 19:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(466476, 44078, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the shadow as the main subject.</td>', 'Nice use of the shadow as the main subject.', '2003-10-29 19:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(466478, 44088, 12733, '<td valign="top">The angles and shadows create an optical illusion - the perception of whether the screws are lying down or standing keeps shifting.</td>', 'The angles and shadows create an optical illusion - the perception of whether the screws are lying down or standing keeps shifting.', '2003-10-29 19:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(466479, 43950, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this shadow, the heart is so wonderful!  Not sure I like the surface it\''s on though, very distracting.  A 9 :)</td>', 'I love this shadow, the heart is so wonderful!  Not sure I like the surface it\''s on though, very distracting.  A 9 :)', '2003-10-29 19:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(466480, 43308, 12733, '<td valign="top">The shadow is clearly the subject, but the texture of the background is really interesting too.</td>', 'The shadow is clearly the subject, but the texture of the background is really interesting too.', '2003-10-29 19:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(466481, 43989, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows and nice reflections.</td>', 'Nice shadows and nice reflections.', '2003-10-29 19:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(466484, 43732, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow effect from the blinds.</td>', 'Nice shadow effect from the blinds.', '2003-10-29 19:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(466486, 43383, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute cat, nice wood textures. The shadow is really kind of incidental.</td>', 'Very cute cat, nice wood textures. The shadow is really kind of incidental.', '2003-10-29 19:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(466488, 43523, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is there a trick to this, or is it a demonstration of the fact that if the light is placed just right, a bent object will look straight because of the straight-on illumination.</td>', 'Is there a trick to this, or is it a demonstration of the fact that if the light is placed just right, a bent object will look straight because of the straight-on illumination.', '2003-10-29 19:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(466493, 43783, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice interplay of object and its shadow.</td>', 'Nice interplay of object and its shadow.', '2003-10-29 19:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(466494, 43638, 9441, '<td valign="top">simple, yet fantastic!  Very crisp and clean shot.</td>', 'simple, yet fantastic!  Very crisp and clean shot.', '2003-10-29 19:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(466495, 43951, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very interesting - shadows with colors in them.</td>', 'Very interesting - shadows with colors in them.', '2003-10-29 19:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(466497, 44098, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shadow to bring out the three-dimensional aspect and the texture.</td>', 'Nice use of shadow to bring out the three-dimensional aspect and the texture.', '2003-10-29 19:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(466500, 44025, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice silhouette, wonderful colors.</td>', 'nice silhouette, wonderful colors.', '2003-10-29 19:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(466501, 44078, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful "canvas" for the shadows...great job on the composition...nice lighting and color.</td>', 'wonderful "canvas" for the shadows...great job on the composition...nice lighting and color.', '2003-10-29 19:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(466504, 44002, 9232, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and the angle at which you caught the shadow to show the arch is great.  The highlights are a little blown out on the toes of the slippers.  9</td>', 'Very good composition and the angle at which you caught the shadow to show the arch is great.  The highlights are a little blown out on the toes of the slippers.  9', '2003-10-29 19:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(466506, 43998, 12733, '<td valign="top">A mysterious and somewhat sinister effect. Great texture on the masonry.</td>', 'A mysterious and somewhat sinister effect. Great texture on the masonry.', '2003-10-29 19:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(466508, 43983, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice color in the shadows - an unusual effect.</td>', 'Nice color in the shadows - an unusual effect.', '2003-10-29 19:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(466509, 44024, 12733, '<td valign="top">The clear areas make the shadow interesting.</td>', 'The clear areas make the shadow interesting.', '2003-10-29 19:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(466512, 43129, 12733, '<td valign="top">A white shadow. It''s a very interesting effect; I''d be interested in finding out how you did it.</td>', 'A white shadow. It''s a very interesting effect; I''d be interested in finding out how you did it.', '2003-10-29 19:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(466513, 44005, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, well executed.</td>', 'Interesting concept, well executed.', '2003-10-29 19:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(466515, 44067, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect. Once you start looking for faces, you find them everywhere. What is it?</td>', 'Very interesting effect. Once you start looking for faces, you find them everywhere. What is it?', '2003-10-29 20:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(466654, 43693, 7810, '<td valign="top">cool effect</td>', 'cool effect', '2003-10-29 21:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(466685, 43903, 13498, '<td valign="top">This is an AWESOME photo and a GREAT idea!</td>', 'This is an AWESOME photo and a GREAT idea!', '2003-10-29 22:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(466690, 43732, 13498, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, nice lines, nice shadow effect in this photo</td>', 'Beautiful, nice lines, nice shadow effect in this photo', '2003-10-29 22:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(466691, 43353, 13498, '<td valign="top">This is a cool effect</td>', 'This is a cool effect', '2003-10-29 22:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(466692, 44004, 13498, '<td valign="top">To dark, can''t see the shadows to get that effect</td>', 'To dark, can''t see the shadows to get that effect', '2003-10-29 22:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(466694, 44087, 13498, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, love fall, this is a good shot!</td>', 'Nice effect, love fall, this is a good shot!', '2003-10-29 22:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(466697, 43819, 13498, '<td valign="top">This is weird! kinda doesn''t fit I don''t think</td>', 'This is weird! kinda doesn''t fit I don''t think', '2003-10-29 22:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(466698, 43934, 13498, '<td valign="top">To many effects going on, it''s taking away from the shadow.</td>', 'To many effects going on, it''s taking away from the shadow.', '2003-10-29 22:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(466699, 44019, 13498, '<td valign="top">This is very cool, love the shadows in this photo</td>', 'This is very cool, love the shadows in this photo', '2003-10-29 22:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(466701, 43923, 13498, '<td valign="top">This is nice, gives it meaning</td>', 'This is nice, gives it meaning', '2003-10-29 22:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(466702, 44075, 13498, '<td valign="top">Gives you that fall feeling inside.. gives me warm thoughts</td>', 'Gives you that fall feeling inside.. gives me warm thoughts', '2003-10-29 22:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(466703, 44049, 13498, '<td valign="top">Kind of on the dark side, Shadows can be light and have alot of meaning.. needs to be a bit lighter to get the feel for the shadow in this photo.</td>', 'Kind of on the dark side, Shadows can be light and have alot of meaning.. needs to be a bit lighter to get the feel for the shadow in this photo.', '2003-10-29 22:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(466704, 43262, 13661, '<td valign="top">Fantastic detail, and great light</td>', 'Fantastic detail, and great light', '2003-10-29 22:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(466705, 44045, 13498, '<td valign="top">Violence, I dont find anything creative about violence, there is no meaning in this photo.</td>', 'Violence, I dont find anything creative about violence, there is no meaning in this photo.', '2003-10-29 22:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(466706, 43884, 13498, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows and nice lines. The bike is nice too :)</td>', 'Nice shadows and nice lines. The bike is nice too :)', '2003-10-29 22:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(466709, 44080, 13498, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my grandmother.. this is a nice photo, one that has alot of meaning.</td>', 'Reminds me of my grandmother.. this is a nice photo, one that has alot of meaning.', '2003-10-29 22:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
