(467798, 44049, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is a good low-key portrait. The light isnt too bright on the face and her expression is still captured, cheeky as it is. Part of me would like to see her be more fuller frame and lose the darkness/shadow on the left, or else have more negative space on the right to follow the path of her eyes.</td>', 'This is a good low-key portrait. The light isnt too bright on the face and her expression is still captured, cheeky as it is. Part of me would like to see her be more fuller frame and lose the darkness/shadow on the left, or else have more negative space on the right to follow the path of her eyes.', '2003-10-30 23:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(467801, 44078, 6008, '<td valign="top">The tone is a nice warm color and I think it works well with the texture of the tiles.  I also like the softness of the shadows. The lines seem straight and do not show any distortion, which is good. I like the gradient color and the exposure looks good. Nicely captured.</td>', 'The tone is a nice warm color and I think it works well with the texture of the tiles.  I also like the softness of the shadows. The lines seem straight and do not show any distortion, which is good. I like the gradient color and the exposure looks good. Nicely captured.', '2003-10-30 23:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(467803, 44019, 6008, '<td valign="top">The color and details are very sharp, as are the leaf and shadows. The grass seems a little dark in the foreground but I think that helps with the contrast of the nicely rich green. It''s a nice capture and likely one we walk past every day (at least during fall), and it''s nice to be able to see a close-up, low-down shot to see just how pretty it can be.</td>', 'The color and details are very sharp, as are the leaf and shadows. The grass seems a little dark in the foreground but I think that helps with the contrast of the nicely rich green. It''s a nice capture and likely one we walk past every day (at least during fall), and it''s nice to be able to see a close-up, low-down shot to see just how pretty it can be.', '2003-10-30 23:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(467805, 43262, 6008, '<td valign="top">Quite a classic image but an effective one. I like the simiplicity of this, as well as the duality of black and white. The details are very nicely sharp, and the highlights do not seem overblown at all.</td>', 'Quite a classic image but an effective one. I like the simiplicity of this, as well as the duality of black and white. The details are very nicely sharp, and the highlights do not seem overblown at all.', '2003-10-30 23:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(467810, 43970, 6008, '<td valign="top">I really like this! The jugs are very sharp, the texture shows up nice. I like the gradient of the background and the way it fades to dark on the left. The lighting is very well done, and of course the shadows are present. This is a very classic still life shot, excellent quality, and very clean. One of my favorites of the challenge so far.</td>', 'I really like this! The jugs are very sharp, the texture shows up nice. I like the gradient of the background and the way it fades to dark on the left. The lighting is very well done, and of course the shadows are present. This is a very classic still life shot, excellent quality, and very clean. One of my favorites of the challenge so far.', '2003-10-30 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(467839, 43890, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent. One of the best.</td>', 'Excellent. One of the best.', '2003-10-31 00:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
