(467868, 43589, 4767, '<td valign="top">I''m speachless.  This is just beautiful!</td>', 'I''m speachless.  This is just beautiful!', '2003-10-31 00:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(467869, 43686, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Epiphone guitars grow wild in your area?  Cool! (But I''m a sucker for diagonals anyhow!)</td>', 'Nice photo.  Epiphone guitars grow wild in your area?  Cool! (But I''m a sucker for diagonals anyhow!)', '2003-10-31 00:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(467870, 43937, 4767, '<td valign="top">The subject of your photo is so ephemeral, so light, so subtle...  HOW can you distract from it with that horrid frame?  It competes so strongly; it ruins a marvellous shot.  This trend of interior frames is NOT this photographs'' friend.  It should be a 9, but the frame steals from its integrity.</td>', 'The subject of your photo is so ephemeral, so light, so subtle...  HOW can you distract from it with that horrid frame?  It competes so strongly; it ruins a marvellous shot.  This trend of interior frames is NOT this photographs'' friend.  It should be a 9, but the frame steals from its integrity.', '2003-10-31 00:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(467871, 43947, 4767, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept!</td>', 'Interesting concept!', '2003-10-31 00:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(467872, 43867, 4767, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, I like the model''s neck... would prefer to see her right eye a little...</td>', 'Interesting lighting, I like the model''s neck... would prefer to see her right eye a little...', '2003-10-31 00:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(467873, 43308, 4767, '<td valign="top">I LIKE this one!  Well done!</td>', 'I LIKE this one!  Well done!', '2003-10-31 00:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(467874, 43727, 4767, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Wish you''d shot it earlier or later, so the light spots weren''t quite to HOT!</td>', 'Interesting.  Wish you''d shot it earlier or later, so the light spots weren''t quite to HOT!', '2003-10-31 00:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(467875, 43394, 4767, '<td valign="top">What an interesting composition!  Well done.  Not at all what the eye expects, is it?  9+</td>', 'What an interesting composition!  Well done.  Not at all what the eye expects, is it?  9+', '2003-10-31 00:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(467876, 44028, 4767, '<td valign="top">Exceptional photo!  Well thought out, beautifully executed!</td>', 'Exceptional photo!  Well thought out, beautifully executed!', '2003-10-31 00:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(467877, 43997, 4767, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  (Didn''t Cat Stevens change his name to Yusuf Islam? Isn''t he the only well known Moslem to condemn the 9/11 attack on America?)  Nice play on his title!</td>', 'Cool shot!  (Didn''t Cat Stevens change his name to Yusuf Islam? Isn''t he the only well known Moslem to condemn the 9/11 attack on America?)  Nice play on his title!', '2003-10-31 01:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(467878, 43903, 4767, '<td valign="top">NICE recreation!  Awesome creativity, BTW!  (staples!  wow!)</td>', 'NICE recreation!  Awesome creativity, BTW!  (staples!  wow!)', '2003-10-31 01:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(467879, 43577, 4767, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwwww............</td>', 'Awwwwwwww............', '2003-10-31 01:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(467881, 43607, 4767, '<td valign="top">Not often photos title themselves.  Nice!</td>', 'Not often photos title themselves.  Nice!', '2003-10-31 01:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(467883, 43732, 4767, '<td valign="top">Lovely model - and a nice treatment of the shadpws...</td>', 'Lovely model - and a nice treatment of the shadpws...', '2003-10-31 01:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(467886, 43928, 4767, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah!  Mondrian would be proud!  NICE eye!!  well seen!</td>', 'Oh yeah!  Mondrian would be proud!  NICE eye!!  well seen!', '2003-10-31 01:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(467888, 43693, 4767, '<td valign="top">Well done; clever!</td>', 'Well done; clever!', '2003-10-31 01:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(467891, 43968, 4767, '<td valign="top">Title could have said ''walking shadow of alien invader''...  cool distortion!</td>', 'Title could have said ''walking shadow of alien invader''...  cool distortion!', '2003-10-31 01:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(467892, 44003, 4767, '<td valign="top">I want to trick ot treat at YOUR house!  Cool carving!</td>', 'I want to trick ot treat at YOUR house!  Cool carving!', '2003-10-31 01:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(467893, 44088, 4767, '<td valign="top">COOL effect!  Lots of work setting those babies up, I''ll bet!</td>', 'COOL effect!  Lots of work setting those babies up, I''ll bet!', '2003-10-31 01:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(467894, 44044, 4767, '<td valign="top">Born to die that we may live.  You missed the important part of that title.</td>', 'Born to die that we may live.  You missed the important part of that title.', '2003-10-31 01:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(467895, 43056, 4767, '<td valign="top">An interesting screen/panel/whatever.  I envy you the options it must give...</td>', 'An interesting screen/panel/whatever.  I envy you the options it must give...', '2003-10-31 01:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(467934, 43437, 11887, '<td valign="top">Simple idea, few elements but great resolution.</td>', 'Simple idea, few elements but great resolution.', '2003-10-31 06:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(467935, 43983, 5728, '<td valign="top">Christmas is coming, thanks for the reminder :-) This is good, I''ve been getting in real close to my monitor trying to catch your reflection in one of the balls, but I can''t see it. That isn''t so easy to do, but you managed it. Also how you managed not to get any reflections at all in the front ball is beyond me. Very symmetrical, well done, I like it.</td>', 'Christmas is coming, thanks for the reminder :-) This is good, I''ve been getting in real close to my monitor trying to catch your reflection in one of the balls, but I can''t see it. That isn''t so easy to do, but you managed it. Also how you managed not to get any reflections at all in the front ball is beyond me. Very symmetrical, well done, I like it.', '2003-10-31 06:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(467938, 43589, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very mellow, very pastel. The orange and violets work very harmoniosly together. The light and shadow mix is spot on, no blow outs at all. Pity about the two white spots on the wine glass though (9)</td>', 'Very mellow, very pastel. The orange and violets work very harmoniosly together. The light and shadow mix is spot on, no blow outs at all. Pity about the two white spots on the wine glass though (9)', '2003-10-31 06:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(467941, 43523, 5728, '<td valign="top">Kewl effect. It is so enjoyable seeing photos with such ideas in the challenges, anything different works with me. This is also well done technically, good lighting, the shadow is sharp. A couple of little blow outs on the fork from the light but it doesn''t  decrease the quality of your image too much.</td>', 'Kewl effect. It is so enjoyable seeing photos with such ideas in the challenges, anything different works with me. This is also well done technically, good lighting, the shadow is sharp. A couple of little blow outs on the fork from the light but it doesn''t  decrease the quality of your image too much.', '2003-10-31 06:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(467969, 43923, 13566, '<td valign="top">Really tidy, effective shot. Like it a lot.</td>', 'Really tidy, effective shot. Like it a lot.', '2003-10-31 08:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(467971, 43732, 13566, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Lovely lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful. Lovely lighting.', '2003-10-31 08:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(467986, 43511, 9448, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Good focus.  Nice DOF.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Good focus.  Nice DOF.  Nice lighting.', '2003-10-31 08:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(467987, 43949, 9448, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Good focus.  Looks a little noisy.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Good focus.  Looks a little noisy.  Good luck.', '2003-10-31 08:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(467989, 43934, 9448, '<td valign="top">Good use of lighting.   Maybe could have used thirds more?  Good luck.</td>', 'Good use of lighting.   Maybe could have used thirds more?  Good luck.', '2003-10-31 08:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(467990, 43919, 9448, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I have my monitor calibrated, but this looks a little dark.  Nice and moody though...</td>', 'Nice composition.  I have my monitor calibrated, but this looks a little dark.  Nice and moody though...', '2003-10-31 08:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(467991, 43951, 9448, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I think I might have panned right a bit more.  Good focus.  Good use of lighting.  Looks a little noisy.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I think I might have panned right a bit more.  Good focus.  Good use of lighting.  Looks a little noisy.  Good luck.', '2003-10-31 08:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(467993, 43605, 9448, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Nice use of thirds.  Good focus.  Nice DOF.  Good use of lighting -- love the reflective bench.  I like the colourisation, nice editing.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Nice use of thirds.  Good focus.  Nice DOF.  Good use of lighting -- love the reflective bench.  I like the colourisation, nice editing.', '2003-10-31 08:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(467996, 44039, 9448, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Maybe rotate a few dgrees counter-clockwise?  Good use of lighting.  Looks a little noisy.  Clever.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Maybe rotate a few dgrees counter-clockwise?  Good use of lighting.  Looks a little noisy.  Clever.  Well done.', '2003-10-31 08:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(467998, 44085, 9448, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Good focus.  Nice DOF.  Good use of lighting.  I like the colourisation, nice editing. Good border.   Well done.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Good focus.  Nice DOF.  Good use of lighting.  I like the colourisation, nice editing. Good border.   Well done.', '2003-10-31 08:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(468121, 43970, 9448, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Good focus.  Nice lighting.  I like the colourisation, nice editing.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Good focus.  Nice lighting.  I like the colourisation, nice editing.  Good luck.', '2003-10-31 12:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(468137, 44050, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good toning, I really like the shade of blue you chose. The shadow within a shadow also adds impact to your image. The lighting is very good, just under the blown out phase at the top of the light bulb. The transgression in the background from blue to black is not hard and abrupt, rather soft and easy. Not much too critique on here.</td>', 'Good toning, I really like the shade of blue you chose. The shadow within a shadow also adds impact to your image. The lighting is very good, just under the blown out phase at the top of the light bulb. The transgression in the background from blue to black is not hard and abrupt, rather soft and easy. Not much too critique on here.', '2003-10-31 12:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(468144, 44100, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp and prominent shadows. The leaves bring in an element of abandoness (hope I spellt that right). Including part of the gate is a matter of taste. For me it works and I would have done the same. I wonder if you get picked on for that.</td>', 'Nice sharp and prominent shadows. The leaves bring in an element of abandoness (hope I spellt that right). Including part of the gate is a matter of taste. For me it works and I would have done the same. I wonder if you get picked on for that.', '2003-10-31 12:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(468147, 43937, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! This is a good example to show that shadows don''t always have to be black and dark. The lighting you set up is fantastic especially the way you have brought in a diagonal gradient. Something different, good show!</td>', 'Wonderful! This is a good example to show that shadows don''t always have to be black and dark. The lighting you set up is fantastic especially the way you have brought in a diagonal gradient. Something different, good show!', '2003-10-31 12:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(468150, 43970, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah very clear and focused still life. The hard light from the right is spot on, just under the "too much" phase, you regulated that one well. The long shadows of the pots extending out into the darkness on the left seems like they are reaching out and wanting to connect.</td>', 'Ah very clear and focused still life. The hard light from the right is spot on, just under the "too much" phase, you regulated that one well. The long shadows of the pots extending out into the darkness on the left seems like they are reaching out and wanting to connect.', '2003-10-31 12:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(468152, 43903, 8637, '<td valign="top">Incredible idea and very well done.</td>', 'Incredible idea and very well done.', '2003-10-31 12:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(468154, 43951, 8637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors...the dark spot detracts a little.</td>', 'Beautiful colors...the dark spot detracts a little.', '2003-10-31 12:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(468156, 43934, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fantastic play of light, and the contrasts within the shadow are great. I really would have included the whole shadow into your image though, the extra negative space wouldn''t have been a problem. It''s still a good pic as it is though.</td>', 'Fantastic play of light, and the contrasts within the shadow are great. I really would have included the whole shadow into your image though, the extra negative space wouldn''t have been a problem. It''s still a good pic as it is though.', '2003-10-31 12:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(468158, 44019, 8637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful idea and excellent macro...very crisp.</td>', 'Beautiful idea and excellent macro...very crisp.', '2003-10-31 12:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(468160, 44041, 8637, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the dirty specks on the left really detract from the overall shot.</td>', 'Nice idea but the dirty specks on the left really detract from the overall shot.', '2003-10-31 12:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(468277, 43970, 12061, '<td valign="top">theme : 3/3<br/>lighting: 3/3<br/>overall quality: 4/4</td>', 'theme : 3/3lighting: 3/3overall quality: 4/4', '2003-10-31 14:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(468278, 43797, 12061, '<td valign="top">theme : 3/3<br/>lighting: 3/3<br/>overall quality: 3/4</td>', 'theme : 3/3lighting: 3/3overall quality: 3/4', '2003-10-31 14:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(468346, 44049, 11324, '<td valign="top">GREAT PHOTO.  Wrong theme.  It would have been an amazing submission for the "lighting" theme.</td>', 'GREAT PHOTO.  Wrong theme.  It would have been an amazing submission for the "lighting" theme.', '2003-10-31 16:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(468368, 44039, 6388, '<td valign="top">that is brilliant.  please tell me you came up with that for this challenge.  maybe not the most technically perfect photo I''ve ever seen here, but far ans away the most creative.  congratulations on a high score from everyone who gets it. :)<br/>Pedro</td>', 'that is brilliant.  please tell me you came up with that for this challenge.  maybe not the most technically perfect photo I''ve ever seen here, but far ans away the most creative.  congratulations on a high score from everyone who gets it. :)Pedro', '2003-10-31 17:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(468377, 44061, 10401, '<td valign="top">I like the composition , but there is serious lack of DOF where needed  SORRY!</td>', 'I like the composition , but there is serious lack of DOF where needed  SORRY!', '2003-10-31 17:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(468380, 43969, 10401, '<td valign="top">NO NO NO</td>', 'NO NO NO', '2003-10-31 17:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(468401, 43935, 5728, '<td valign="top">She''s a real cutie. Good idea with the shadows across her body, I went for a similar idea. Maybe a little on the soft side and a kick on the contrast would have helped some. The house in the background is a little bothersome, a shooting postion more to the right and pointing towards the fence would have kept the house out of the frame.</td>', 'She''s a real cutie. Good idea with the shadows across her body, I went for a similar idea. Maybe a little on the soft side and a kick on the contrast would have helped some. The house in the background is a little bothersome, a shooting postion more to the right and pointing towards the fence would have kept the house out of the frame.', '2003-10-31 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(468404, 43941, 5728, '<td valign="top">The idea is good. I have a couple of suggestions for you though. The shadow is too centered in your image, the plants are kind of grainy and out of focus and the background is a tad overexposed. I hope that was of some help to you.</td>', 'The idea is good. I have a couple of suggestions for you though. The shadow is too centered in your image, the plants are kind of grainy and out of focus and the background is a tad overexposed. I hope that was of some help to you.', '2003-10-31 18:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(468405, 44024, 5728, '<td valign="top">The composition is good, rules of thirds etc. The whole image comes over a little on the flat side. A boost in the contrasts would have done this wonders, especially bringing out the colors in the ball more.</td>', 'The composition is good, rules of thirds etc. The whole image comes over a little on the flat side. A boost in the contrasts would have done this wonders, especially bringing out the colors in the ball more.', '2003-10-31 18:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(468409, 43968, 10084, '<td valign="top">Shadows have good contrast. Very strong bold images. You can almost feel the rough texture of the concrete. I think that if you were to crop the foot in the subject out the shadow would have more of a  impact. This is a very good idea.</td>', 'Shadows have good contrast. Very strong bold images. You can almost feel the rough texture of the concrete. I think that if you were to crop the foot in the subject out the shadow would have more of a  impact. This is a very good idea.', '2003-10-31 18:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(468416, 44088, 5728, '<td valign="top">I really like your idea here, the screws look as if they are floating above the background. It must have taken you a while to set this one up and get the lighting spot on. Something different for sure!</td>', 'I really like your idea here, the screws look as if they are floating above the background. It must have taken you a while to set this one up and get the lighting spot on. Something different for sure!', '2003-10-31 18:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(468417, 44041, 5728, '<td valign="top">Pretty grainy and spotty, especially under the dog''s nose. Also I would have left some more room in front of the dog''s nose, it seems a little too tightly cropped on that side.</td>', 'Pretty grainy and spotty, especially under the dog''s nose. Also I would have left some more room in front of the dog''s nose, it seems a little too tightly cropped on that side.', '2003-10-31 18:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(468418, 43383, 5728, '<td valign="top">Okay I just did Dsidwells''s 30 second take on this pic. Looking for what you wanted to show us. The composition is good. The shadow shows me it is late in the day. Sharper would have done this a lot of justice, I am missing the details.</td>', 'Okay I just did Dsidwells''s 30 second take on this pic. Looking for what you wanted to show us. The composition is good. The shadow shows me it is late in the day. Sharper would have done this a lot of justice, I am missing the details.', '2003-10-31 18:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(468426, 43394, 7810, '<td valign="top">great image...meets the challenge!!! no 1 for me</td>', 'great image...meets the challenge!!! no 1 for me', '2003-10-31 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(468443, 43675, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, very elegant and crisp.  THe lighting is perfect and the detail and focus are great as well.  Very nicely done.  10</td>', 'Wonderful image, very elegant and crisp.  THe lighting is perfect and the detail and focus are great as well.  Very nicely done.  10', '2003-10-31 19:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(468445, 43686, 11923, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast.  Good lighting, nice focus.  I think the light is a little on the harsh side, but with the composition it does work.  Very interesting image.  Well done.  8</td>', 'Love the contrast.  Good lighting, nice focus.  I think the light is a little on the harsh side, but with the composition it does work.  Very interesting image.  Well done.  8', '2003-10-31 19:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(468446, 44023, 11923, '<td valign="top">An interesting image.  I like the energy between the two focal points.  Unfortunately, the shadow is a little too soft.  Its hard to determine (for me) what exactly is going on.  It looks like the person is hanging or has been thunked in the head with something.  I wish the shadow had just a bit more sharpness.  Great focus on the girl, I like that only part of her face is showing.  Very nicely done.  8</td>', 'An interesting image.  I like the energy between the two focal points.  Unfortunately, the shadow is a little too soft.  Its hard to determine (for me) what exactly is going on.  It looks like the person is hanging or has been thunked in the head with something.  I wish the shadow had just a bit more sharpness.  Great focus on the girl, I like that only part of her face is showing.  Very nicely done.  8', '2003-10-31 19:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(468447, 43947, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, reminds me of a commercial I saw on tv for a printer.  I like the clarity of the image, nice focus and lighting.  There seems to be some distortion possibly from resizing though - a little distracting.  Very nice overall.  8</td>', 'Interesting image, reminds me of a commercial I saw on tv for a printer.  I like the clarity of the image, nice focus and lighting.  There seems to be some distortion possibly from resizing though - a little distracting.  Very nice overall.  8', '2003-10-31 19:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(468449, 44005, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh, fun image.  Good focus on the shadow, I like the composition as well.  Overall cool tone is nice too.  Nicely done.  7</td>', 'Heh, fun image.  Good focus on the shadow, I like the composition as well.  Overall cool tone is nice too.  Nicely done.  7', '2003-10-31 19:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(468466, 43890, 6536, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Very creative idea. Perfect composition and cropping. Nice lighting and shadow effects. Good focus and DOF. 9.</td>', 'Great shot. Very creative idea. Perfect composition and cropping. Nice lighting and shadow effects. Good focus and DOF. 9.', '2003-10-31 20:28:39.000000', NULL, 1);
