(468952, 43417, 3540, '<td valign="top">Easily the best picture of the challenge that I''ve seen so far.   If you could PS the flares off the lights on the center of the bridge, easily 10.  as is, 9.  And I think my congratulations on a ribbon might be a bit premature, but I haven''t seen anything this good yet.  This is stunning.</td>', 'Easily the best picture of the challenge that I''ve seen so far.   If you could PS the flares off the lights on the center of the bridge, easily 10.  as is, 9.  And I think my congratulations on a ribbon might be a bit premature, but I haven''t seen anything this good yet.  This is stunning.', '2003-11-01 08:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(468953, 43871, 3540, '<td valign="top">The blue is a little bit grainy.  My guess is oversaturated.  Nice concept for the photo and well executed.  I think I''d have cropped the top of this photo off and lost most of the blackness and other unrelated stuff from the top so I couldn''t made the geese a little bit bigger in the frame.  The colors are very good and really add a lot ot the mood of the shot.  I just think they are a little oversaturated.</td>', 'The blue is a little bit grainy.  My guess is oversaturated.  Nice concept for the photo and well executed.  I think I''d have cropped the top of this photo off and lost most of the blackness and other unrelated stuff from the top so I couldn''t made the geese a little bit bigger in the frame.  The colors are very good and really add a lot ot the mood of the shot.  I just think they are a little oversaturated.', '2003-11-01 08:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(468955, 43970, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I think cropping a bit off the left side to make the jugs just a little bigger in the frame would''ve been my preference, but its very good like this.  Well executed very clear shot.  I''m guessing you are doing pretty well with this one.  Nice work 8</td>', 'Excellent.  I think cropping a bit off the left side to make the jugs just a little bigger in the frame would''ve been my preference, but its very good like this.  Well executed very clear shot.  I''m guessing you are doing pretty well with this one.  Nice work 8', '2003-11-01 08:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
