(470513, 43675, 1005, '<td valign="top">Not too bad of a showing, though I think this should have placed just a little better.  I think too many missed the heart part.  The symmetry really does work nicely.  A little more breathing space, a tad less harsh lighting and a crisper shadow should have placed this in the top ten.  It was a really great idea, very creative.  I didn''t vote, but had I, 8.</td>', 'Not too bad of a showing, though I think this should have placed just a little better.  I think too many missed the heart part.  The symmetry really does work nicely.  A little more breathing space, a tad less harsh lighting and a crisper shadow should have placed this in the top ten.  It was a really great idea, very creative.  I didn''t vote, but had I, 8.', '2003-11-03 01:14:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(470516, 43871, 1005, '<td valign="top">Renee, this is a really beatiful shot.  Placing in the upper third is really quite good!  Only one 1 vote, also very good.  The silhouettes are very pleasing and the color bold and eye catchy.  I like the transition of color across the image, but I agree that a little closer view of the geese (maybe a landscape crop) would have added a touch to this, still I like that color transition.  I''d call this photographer''s choice.  I didn''t vote this challenge, but I think this is an easy 8, maybe a 9.  Rob</td>', 'Renee, this is a really beatiful shot.  Placing in the upper third is really quite good!  Only one 1 vote, also very good.  The silhouettes are very pleasing and the color bold and eye catchy.  I like the transition of color across the image, but I agree that a little closer view of the geese (maybe a landscape crop) would have added a touch to this, still I like that color transition.  I''d call this photographer''s choice.  I didn''t vote this challenge, but I think this is an easy 8, maybe a 9.  Rob', '2003-11-03 01:20:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(470522, 43970, 8953, '<td valign="top">Your efforts paid off! Top prize! Good job! For the record...I came back through during voting and had given this a ten. <br/> <br/>keep up the good work<br/> <br/>Richard<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-03 01:34:21.</i></td>', 'Your efforts paid off! Top prize! Good job! For the record...I came back through during voting and had given this a ten.  keep up the good work Richard', '2003-11-03 01:33:46.000000', '2003-11-03 01:34:21.000000', 0),
