(477201, 44061, 6202, '<td valign="top">"Critique Club"<br/> <br/>Very nice composition but the lighting seems to be playing games with you here.  The shadows are excellent, but there is just to much lighting and it cause overexposed areas.<br/> <br/>Looking at the angles of the lighting I would say it is a case of just too much sunlight causing this.<br/> <br/>You did meet the challenge well just watch out for to much light spoiling a potentially excellent shot.</td>', '"Critique Club" Very nice composition but the lighting seems to be playing games with you here.  The shadows are excellent, but there is just to much lighting and it cause overexposed areas. Looking at the angles of the lighting I would say it is a case of just too much sunlight causing this. You did meet the challenge well just watch out for to much light spoiling a potentially excellent shot.', '2003-11-08 07:49:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(477208, 44003, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club"<br/> <br/>Very interesting image.  But I think you have a small problem lack of shadows.  As stated in your comments during the challenge it appears to be more of a silhouette than a shadow.  I sat here and thought a minute of what you were doing and I understand that it is a shadow but I do believe most voters thought it was silhouette.<br/> <br/>The composition is good and your lighting technic made this interesting.  Just think that the absents of obvious shadows hurt you greatly.<br/></td>', '*Critique Club" Very interesting image.  But I think you have a small problem lack of shadows.  As stated in your comments during the challenge it appears to be more of a silhouette than a shadow.  I sat here and thought a minute of what you were doing and I understand that it is a shadow but I do believe most voters thought it was silhouette. The composition is good and your lighting technic made this interesting.  Just think that the absents of obvious shadows hurt you greatly.', '2003-11-08 08:11:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(477958, 43903, 14001, '<td valign="top">I love this image, but either you made a huge (in my mind) technical mistake, or I''m missing the point:<br/> <br/>The shadows being present signify that even though they are gone, they are still in our hearts and minds, and cannot be removed which is signified by the beacon.<br/> <br/>Very cool, but should their be shadows of the twin towers in the foreground?  Seems like a significant mistake.</td>', 'I love this image, but either you made a huge (in my mind) technical mistake, or I''m missing the point: The shadows being present signify that even though they are gone, they are still in our hearts and minds, and cannot be removed which is signified by the beacon. Very cool, but should their be shadows of the twin towers in the foreground?  Seems like a significant mistake.', '2003-11-09 13:47:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(480122, 43580, 656, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on trying to do something interesting.<br/> <br/>I think the web is probably about the worst possible media to try and<br/>show shots like this on though - all the tones are lost and I don''t<br/>see it the way you want people to see it.<br/> <br/>Keep up the interesting entries!</td>', 'Congratulations on trying to do something interesting. I think the web is probably about the worst possible media to try andshow shots like this on though - all the tones are lost and I don''tsee it the way you want people to see it. Keep up the interesting entries!', '2003-11-11 10:13:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(480778, 43969, 5391, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot - great dynamic perspective and composition.  I love the spectral highlight in the bottom corner, and the shadow of the car is a surprise - it makes you look twice and wonder where it''s coming from.  Good creative shot.  I gave it a 7.  You''re right about the cloning tool - if you could get rid of the lens flare it would easily be an 8 or 9.  :)</td>', 'I really like this shot - great dynamic perspective and composition.  I love the spectral highlight in the bottom corner, and the shadow of the car is a surprise - it makes you look twice and wonder where it''s coming from.  Good creative shot.  I gave it a 7.  You''re right about the cloning tool - if you could get rid of the lens flare it would easily be an 8 or 9.  :)', '2003-11-11 18:09:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(486866, 43903, 14001, '<td valign="top">Didn''t know the rules when I made my post.....You couldn''t remove the foreground shadows, against the rules.<br/> <br/>My Bad!<br/> <br/>Nice pic, and just reminds me how you don''t always need to obsess over the details to have an excellent pic.</td>', 'Didn''t know the rules when I made my post.....You couldn''t remove the foreground shadows, against the rules. My Bad! Nice pic, and just reminds me how you don''t always need to obsess over the details to have an excellent pic.', '2003-11-16 10:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
