(545818, 43950, 14603, '<td valign="top">Since joining DPC in November (2003), I`ve been pleasantly surprised at the quality of the work that gets submitted.<br/>However, this particular shot caught my eye almost immediately, and still remains my favourite piece of photography on view here.<br/>From the idea to the execution..it is absolutely perfect.<br/>I know it`s a bit late in the day...but congratulations on a superb job and one which I use as a benchmark for my work.<br/>(Still a long way off, but I`m hopeful)<br/>Gordon</td>', 'Since joining DPC in November (2003), I`ve been pleasantly surprised at the quality of the work that gets submitted.However, this particular shot caught my eye almost immediately, and still remains my favourite piece of photography on view here.From the idea to the execution..it is absolutely perfect.I know it`s a bit late in the day...but congratulations on a superb job and one which I use as a benchmark for my work.(Still a long way off, but I`m hopeful)Gordon', '2004-01-16 12:45:50.000000', NULL, 0),
